# <% .Name %>

The operator pack of <% .Group %>/<% .Kind %>: the object kind, the ACL policy
bound to the controller job and the controller job, applied as one release
(kind and policy first, the job last; uninstall in reverse order).

```shell
norca pack plan ./pack/<% .Name %>
norca pack run  ./pack/<% .Name %> --name=<% .Name %>
norca pack status <% .Name %>
norca pack uninstall <% .Name %>
```

Keep `templates/_helpers.tpl` in line with `<% .KindLower %>.schema.json` of
the project.
